  "contentHtml": "<p><br></p><p><br></p><p>방과후와 자율동아리 연계로 지난주에 오징어 해부를 진행했어요~</p><p>해부 실험을 한번도 안해본 학생들이 많아서 너무 신기해하더라구요. </p><p>새로 산 해부기를 개시한터라 위생걱정은 없이 해부 후에 깨끗하게 씻어서 오징어 라면도 끓여먹었어요ㅎㅎ</p><p><br></p><p>오징어 해부 수업에 사용한 PPT를 공유합니다~</p><p><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DdSQv%26dataid%3D158%26fileid%3D6%26regdt%3D20190523185059&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile255.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F99D9154E5CE66D3520A274')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/editor/icon/editor/p_etc_s.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"/> 오징어해부.pptx</a></p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PeI5k5tlrXE\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PeI5k5tlrXE</a></p><p>실험 과정은 <span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">↑<font face=\"Gulim\"> 위의 영상을 캡쳐해서 넣었습니다~~! 이 영상이 없었다면 시도도 하기 힘들었을거에요.</font></span></p><p><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><font face=\"Gulim\">근데 PPT에 오징어 생식소 부분 설명은 다시 보니 틀린 것 같기도 하네요ㅠㅠ </font></span></p><p><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/990AE34E5CE66BDE10\" class=\"txc-image\" actualwidth=\"1024\" width=\"1024\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"1.PNG\" /></p><p><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><font face=\"Gulim\"><br></font></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99C6064E5CE66BDE1F\" class=\"txc-image\" actualwidth=\"1024\" width=\"1024\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"2.PNG\" /></p><p><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><font face=\"Gulim\"><br></font></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99C7FC4E5CE66BDF1F\" class=\"txc-image\" actualwidth=\"1024\" width=\"1024\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"3.PNG\" /></p><p><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><font face=\"Gulim\"><br></font></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99D9154E5CE66BE01E\" class=\"txc-image\" actualwidth=\"1024\" width=\"1024\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"4.PNG\" /></p><p><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><font face=\"Gulim\"><br></font></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99F0B34E5CE66BE11D\" class=\"txc-image\" actualwidth=\"1024\" width=\"1024\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"5.PNG\" /></p><p><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><font face=\"Gulim\"><br></font></span></p><p><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><font face=\"Gulim\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">PPT 템플릿의 출처는&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"> <a href=\"https://blog.naver.com/hsh6051/220227772256\">https://blog.naver.com/hsh6051/220227772256</a></span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;이고, 폰트는 '배달의민족 한나체' 입니다.&nbsp;</span></span></font></span></p><p><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><font face=\"Gulim\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><font face=\"Gulim\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><br></span></font></span></span></font></span></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
